# Vendored adapter captures: byte copies of files span-panel-api owns, held to
# their source byte for byte by tests/test_fixture_provenance.py. A formatter and
# a byte-identical vendored fixture cannot both be unconditional, and it is the
# formatter that has to yield -- the bytes are the artifact.
#
# Prophylactic today: nothing here runs Prettier over JSON (scripts/fix-markdown.sh
# passes only *.md globs, and prek.toml has no Prettier hook). But .prettierrc sets
# tabWidth 2 and these captures are 1-space indented as their producer wrote them,
# so the day a JSON glob is added they would be silently reindented and the guard
# would start failing with nobody knowing why.
tests/fixtures/schema_*.json

